note linear: o[M,N] = c[N] + a[M,K] @ w[N,K]^T, the addmm of a torch.nn.Linear whose weight transpose
note (aten.permute [1,0]) feeds only this addmm; w is read in place, nothing is copied. Each sum starts
note at the bias, is summed in f64 and rounded once to f32. Consts M K N MK NK MN come first.
fn lindot c view f32 N a view f32 MK w view f32 NK i ulong j ulong to f64
s = f64 get c j
ia = mul i K
iw = mul j K
for k ulong K
s = add s mul f64 get a ia f64 get w iw
ia = add ia 1
iw = add iw 1
end
ret s
end
fn linear c view f32 N a view f32 MK w view f32 NK o edit f32 MN to void
for i ulong M
for j ulong N
put o add mul i N j f32 lindot c a w i j
end
end
end
